      "locator": "1KI 18:45",
      "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
      "text": "In a little while, the sky grew black with clouds and wind, and there was a great rain. Ahab rode, and went to Jezreel.",
      "textSHA256": "514c68fda07d0d4630b7c855520aa7aadbc9b5481a50c51d977398d6a3209e9a"
    },
    {
