      "retrievedAtUTC": "2026-10-16T02:40:00Z",
      "locator": "1KI 18:46",
      "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
      "text": "The LORD’s hand was on Elijah; and he tucked his cloak into his belt and ran before Ahab to the entrance of Jezreel.",
      "textSHA256": "a82cc7d7bcbf3fdc199a3e40d56202fec0ead4cc8dce2b2f9aab1f72dbfe3bf3"
    },
    {
      "sourceID": "webp-1ki-21-1",
