      "retrievedAtUTC": "2026-10-16T02:40:00Z",
      "locator": "1KI 21:1",
      "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
      "text": "After these things, Naboth the Jezreelite had a vineyard which was in Jezreel, next to the palace of Ahab king of Samaria.",
      "textSHA256": "2f71fe7d4f0af3f1a1c91f78d8f54d4dc5d9917056affa83d3523d3f5b019a82"
    },
    {
      "sourceID": "webp-1ki-21-23",
