      "retrievedAtUTC": "2026-10-16T02:40:00Z",
      "locator": "1KI 21:23",
      "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
      "text": "The LORD also spoke of Jezebel, saying, “The dogs will eat Jezebel by the rampart of Jezreel.",
